@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@userId = 1
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 1
@orderId = 1


### 1. 创建订单成功
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1
}


### 2. 查询订单，确认 expireTime 有值、payTime 为 null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}


### 3. 支付订单成功，确认 payTime 有值
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/pay


### 4. 已支付订单不能取消
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel


### 5. 创建一个用于取消的订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1
}


### 6. 取消未支付订单成功
### 将 @orderId 改成第 5 步返回的新订单 id 后再执行
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel


### 7. 重复取消同一订单，不应重复回滚库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel


### 8. 已取消订单不能支付
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/pay


### 9. 查询用户订单列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/orders
